Standard NeuroML Types



This example uses iri: neuroml:pointCellCondBased with nested components for ion channels (ionChannelHH, ionChannelPassive) and gates (gateHHrates). TVBO’s adapter detects these annotations and emits standard NeuroML2 XML elements rather than custom ComponentType definitions. This preserves the hierarchical RK4 evaluation order in jLEMS, so the traces match the reference simulation to correlation r ≈ 1 at the original step size (0.01 ms) — no gate_rate_scale hack needed.

